From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:37:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] cli: run TypeScript workflows with codemod workflow run
 -w workflow.ts

A .ts or .mts workflow is bundled by orchestration-build and run in this
process by the QuickJS host, with --input for the root input and
--history to resume a failed run. YAML workflows are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
